        <span>04.2 · interactive</span>
        <h2>Scheduler laboratory.</h2>
        <p>Three runs share one process. Compare a blocking loop, async I/O without guest CPU yields, and async I/O with cooperative Wasm slices.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="toy scheduler-lab" data-scheduler-lab>
        <div class="toy-toolbar">
